20598972503", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035413_1156220602305836_4459261898112997164_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zgkFgkoq1PkQ7kNvwG5wxbu&_nc_oc=AdlStvbsOtTuUrRcR5mGBCBxx9j4xE-GSG9wVYPNtFE2GL6gkGtMZTGmi8rGENfxU-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzc_SitAl6iSyQ287WrIZXinvJd8VLymUTWncnivpXF8w&oe=69B1457B"}, "display_name": "Motocross Offroad", "keywords": ["motorbike", "motocross", "offroad", "race", "bike"], "long_description": "Physics : \ud83c\udfcd\ufe0f\nDifferent motorbikes with realistic physics without motion sickness. Each motorbike has unique riding experience. \n\nMaps :\ud83c\udf28\ufe0f\u2744\ufe0f\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f\ud83c\udf19\nNavigate rocky canyons, splash through mud pits, and catch air off natural jumps. Feel the rush as you lean into turns, surrounded by towering pine trees and sun-drenched vistas.\n\n\ud83c\udfc1Beat the AI enemies and take the keys of motorbikes! \ud83c\udfc1\n\n", "short_description": "In \u201cMotocross Offroad\u201d riders strap on their virtual reality headsets and become off-road warriors. Picture yourself gripping the handlebars of a rugged dirt bike, the engine growling as you tear through wild landscapes. Whether you\u2019re battling it out in intense races, conquering treacherous trails, or pulling off gravity-defying stunts, this game delivers the full-throttle experience.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "None Play Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://noneplaygames.com.tr/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "None Play Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://noneplaygames.com.tr/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQ